 "text": "Hello, how's everything with you? That's lovely. Do you want it to be formal or casual? You don't need to be. A simple afternoon tea is low pressure. Tea and sandwiches, maybe some pastries, and you can sit on a blanket by the lake. You' need your own, they' usually thin aluminum. Sure, I' wait. Of course. No worries. Think of it as a date with yourself to catch up on sleep. Then offer to leave work early and head straight there. Sorry, I've already booked the spot. You are too. Let's reschedule. Welcome back. So, picnic weekend is off, and you and I chatted about your boss. How's Saturday looking for you and your partner?",
